# AWCMS — English catalog (ADR-0095).
#
# English is the SOURCE language: every `msgid` in this repo is the English text
# that appears on screen. So this file is deliberately a template whose entries
# carry EMPTY `msgstr` values — a lookup miss and an empty translation take the
# same path in `createTranslator`, and both fall back to the `msgid`, which is
# already the correct English.
#
# It exists anyway, rather than being skipped, for two reasons:
#   1. It is the inventory of every translatable string — `i18n:catalog:check`
#      compares the msgids the CODE uses against this file, so a string nobody
#      added here is reported rather than silently untranslatable.
#   2. A future en-GB/en-US split, or an English rewording that should not
#      change every other catalog's msgid, has a place to land.
#
# Entries with a non-empty msgstr are the exception, not the rule: they are the
# cases where the on-screen English must differ from the msgid used as the key.
msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Project-Id-Version: awcms\n"
"Language: en\n"
"MIME-Version: 1.0\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\n"
"Plural-Forms: nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);\n"

